        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Round_Lake%2C_Minnesota",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1889 the town was re‑platted, correcting legal issues, and nine years later it boasted a bank, newspaper, and 179 residents.",
